  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TPP WILPF  Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WILPF Zimbabwe are partners to WILPF Sweden (IKFF) and one of the organisations implementing the Transformative Partnership Program (TPP). The grant will help WILPF Zimbabwe transition from a growing organisation to a fully established and resilient feminist peace movement in Zimbabwe. The TPP grant will also reinforce WILPF Zimbabwe&#x2019;s programming by integrating community focused initiatives aimed at building climate-resilient and peaceful communities. The organization will conduct awareness and education programmes on sustainable environmental practices, facilitate community dialogues on peace and gender equality, and deepen engagement on the Women, Peace and Security (WPS) agenda. Engaging men as partners in peacebuilding, strengthening HIV/AIDS programming, and promoting access to education for marginalised girls and boys will further enhance community empowerment&#x201d;</narrative>
  </description>
